        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the woman with long dark hair in <Picture 1>, wearing a black sleeveless dress.\n<Picture 1> is the source image for <Subject 1>'s appearance and pose.\n<Picture 2> is the environment reference, defining the rainy Tokyo night atmosphere, neon lighting, wet pavement, and reflections.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video depicts <Subject 1> walking through a rainy Tokyo street as shown in <Picture 2>, preserving her appearance and the environment's atmosphere.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the woman’s face, hairstyle, clothing, and overall appearance are retained.\n<Picture 1> (defines <Subject 1>): fully_preserved - the reference image serves as the concrete visual anchor for the subject's identity.\n<Picture 2> (environment): fully_preserved - the rainy Tokyo night atmosphere, neon lighting, wet pavement, and reflections are retained.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video uses a cinematic style with shallow depth of field and soft lighting to evoke a sense of urban solitude.\n[Shot 1] At 00:00.000, a medium-wide shot establishes <Subject 1>, the woman with long dark hair in a black sleeveless dress, walking along a wet Tokyo street at night. The scene is based on <Picture 2>, featuring blurred neon lights reflecting off the pavement and towering buildings. Rain falls steadily. The camera follows her from behind as she walks naturally, her footsteps audible on the wet pavement. She glances around at the vibrant neon signs, then slowly turns toward the camera with a subtle, fleeting smile. The shot continues for 5 seconds.\n[Shot 2] At 00:05.000, the camera smoothly tracks <Subject 1> as she continues walking down the street, maintaining the medium-wide angle and shallow depth of field. The neon lights continue to reflect off the wet pavement, creating a dynamic visual effect. The shot ends at 00:10.000.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nRealistic rain ambience and subtle footsteps on wet pavement are continuous throughout the video.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nRestrained cinematic background music with a melancholic tone plays softly underneath the rain and footsteps, enhancing the sense of urban solitude."
